Package: scworkbench
Type: Package
Title: A Typed, Disk-Backed Substrate for Single-Cell Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Hendrik",
      family = "de Weerd",
      email = "dirkdeweerd.work@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides a disk-backed, typed computational substrate for
    reproducible single-cell analysis. Analysis bundles store matrices,
    embeddings, cell sets, feature sets, fitted models, promoted result
    artifacts, and provenance. Exported getters provide stable access to
    bundle state, while explicit operations produce typed primitives and
    inspectable analysis lineage. The package supports portable, branchable
    workflows across R, Python-backed methods, viewers, and other clients.
